{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25862","headline":"却过淮阴吊韩信庙 · 李绅","name":"却过淮阴吊韩信庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功高自弃汉元臣，遗庙阴森楚水滨。\n英主任贤增虎翼，假王徼福犯龙鳞。\n贱能忍耻卑狂少，贵乏怀忠近佞人。\n徒用千金酬一饭，不知明哲重防身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}